		{"id":"tuto_apology","type":"text","text":"❓ This tutorial is too long!\n---\nI apologize, this is brand new game engine, a lot of things need to be explained.\n  Feel free to skip everything you want, or look at the ⚙️ options to customize your experience.","x":2370,"y":1220,"width":300,"height":200,"color":"1"},
		{
			"id":"53f219ea36851a65",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"edit mode",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":6000,
			"y":1940,
			"width":260,
			"height":60,
			"color":"1"
		},
		{"id":"tuto_colors","type":"text","text":"❓ What's up with the colors?\n---\nWIP: Buttons have colors, you can see how many you got in this menu. This is meant to help people track progress. maybe i'll add completion rates at the bottom though its hard in HTML 🎨","x":2780,"y":920,"width":300,"height":200,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"tuto_archive","type":"text","text":"❓ Help, my screen is full of stuff!\n---\nWIP: The thread 🧵 button helps navigate between open threads. The 🗑️ button will give you options to cleanup READ messages. 💾 there will be a save management file to allow EASY sync between different devices/different scenarii of the game engine maybe","x":2440,"y":960,"width":300,"height":200,"color":"1"},
		{
			"id":"fe88966496d9ac52",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"history of game is another dlc",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":4300,
